x-e6a322de0b29adb9 py-24 bg-white"><div class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 text-center mb-12 fade-up-section"><div class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-blue-50 rounded-full px-4 py-2 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark h-4 w-4 text-blue-600" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><span class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-600">FAQ</span></div><h2 class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4">Frequently Asked <span class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-600">Questions</span></h2><p class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 text-lg text-slate-600">Got questions? We've got answers</p></div><div class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 space-y-4 fade-up-section"><details class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 group bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-100 transition"><summary class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 font-semibold text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between list-none">What types of businesses can use SmartOffice?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-5 w-5 text-slate-500 group-open:rotate-90 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></summary><p class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 text-slate-600 mt-3 pl-0 text-sm">SmartOffice is designed for any business that manages appointments - healthcare, legal, education, beauty, corporate, retail, and more. Our platform is highly customizable to fit your specific needs.</p></details><details class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 group bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-100 transition"><summary class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 font-semibold text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between list-none">Is my data secure?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-5 w-5 text-slate-500 group-open:rotate-90 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></summary><p class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 text-slate-600 mt-3 pl-0 text-sm">Absolutely! We use bank-grade 256-bit encryption, regular security audits, and comply with GDPR, CCPA, and HIPAA standards. Your data is backed up daily and stored securely.</p></details><details class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 group bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-100 transition"><summary class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 font-semibold text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between list-none">Can I sync with my existing calendar?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-5 w-5 text-slate-500 group-open:rotate-90 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></summary><p class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 text-slate-600 mt-3 pl-0 text-sm">Yes! SmartOffice integrates seamlessly with Google Calendar, Outlook, iCal, and other major calendar platforms. Two-way sync ensures your schedule is always up to date.</p></details><details class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 group bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-100 transition"><summary class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 font-semibold text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between list-none">Do you offer a free trial?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-5 w-5 text-slate-500 group-open:rotate-90 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></summary><p class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 text-slate-600 mt-3 pl-0 text-sm">Yes, we offer a 14-day free trial with no credit card required. You can explore all features and see if SmartOffice is right for your business.</p></details><details class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 group bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4 cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-100 transition"><summary class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 font-semibold text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between list-none">What kind of support do you provide?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right h-5 w-5 text-slate-500 group-open:rotate-90 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></summary><p class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 text-slate-600 mt-3 pl-0 text-sm">We offer 24/7 email and chat support for all plans. Professional and Enterprise plans include priority phone support and dedicated account managers.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 py-24 bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 via-purple-600 to-pink-600"><div class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center px-4"><div class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full px-4 py-2 mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rocket h-4 w-4 text-white" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5"></path><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09"></path><path d="M9 12a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.4 22.4 0 0 1-4 2z"></path><path d="M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 .05 5 .05"></path></svg><span class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 text-sm font-medium text-white">✨ Ready to Transform Your Office? ✨</span></div><h2 class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Start Your Free Trial Today</h2><p class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 text-xl text-indigo-100 mb-8">No credit card required. Cancel anytime.</p><button class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 group bg-white text-indigo-600 px-10 py-4 rounded-2xl font-bold text-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300 inline-flex items-center gap-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rocket h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5"></path><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09"></path><path d="M9 12a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.4 22.4 0 0 1-4 2z"></path><path d="M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 .05 5 .05"></path></svg> Get Started Free</button></div></section><footer class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 bg-slate-900 text-white py-16"><div class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-12"><div class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9"><div class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 flex items-center space-x-2 mb-4"><div class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-purple-600 p-2 rounded-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar h-6 w-6 text-white" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18"></path></svg></div><span class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 text-2xl font-bold">Smart<span class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 text-indigo-400">Office</span></span></div><p class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 text-slate-400 text-sm">Revolutionizing office management with intelligent scheduling solutions for any business.</p><div class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 flex gap-4 mt-6"><a href="http://localhost:3000/#" class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 bg-slate-800 p-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-[#1877f2] transition"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-share h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2v13"></path><path d="m16 6-4-4-4 4"></path><path d="M4 12v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-8"></path></svg></a><a href="http://localhost:3000/#" class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 bg-slate-800 p-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-[#1da1f2] transition"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719"></path></svg></a><a href="http://localhost:3000/#" class="jsx-e6a322de0b29adb9 bg-slate-800 p-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-[#0a66c2] transition"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="